			"notes": "## Usage\n\nWith the mod in your mods folder, every created world will be forced into hardcore and you will always spawn with only half a heart.\n\n## Info\n\nThis mod is valid for speedruns on http://speedrun.com/mc_dmce HHH categories.\n\n## Changelog\n\n### v1.1.0\n- Added more support for MC versions and fabric versions.\n\n### v1.0.2\n- Basic Functionality"
